{"version":1,"content":"<p>飯後運動是降低血糖的重要一環，近期台灣一位醫生提出一套60分鐘控糖公式，只要將吃飯速度、餐後休息及散步三者配合，不用另外安排大量運動時間，即可有效降低血糖，減少餐後嗜睡的情況。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;由台灣陳承勤醫生提出</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:33.120952+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:00:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.631076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.631076+00:00","content_hash":"617233f409678de2bfaa18aee4df994c46329763fbef04d5ec94ebd47b98bc43","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}